exists su name author prompter ob text "Draft: be concise and friendly." be text ya
exists su name reviewer prompter ob text "Review the prior exchange. Return PASS or FAIL, and if FAIL add a short reason after a newline." be text ya

exists su name author be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" fromtext name author prompter ya
exists su name reviewer be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" fromtext name reviewer prompter ya

exists su name task ob text "Write a short greeting." be text ya

su name reviewer try ob name text task to name text output be ceremony def
su name sketch out ob name task for name author to name text sketch out by num 0 be write do
exists su name review session be series def
su name user ob text of task be text ya
su name assistant ob text of sketch out be text ya
prah
su name review out ob text "Review the prior exchange and respond now." for name reviewer accordingto name review session to name text review out by num 0 be write do

su name accept draft to name text decision out be ceremony def
  exists su name decision out ob text "" be text ya
  ob name sketch out to name decision out be plus do
prah

su name revise draft to name text decision out be ceremony def
  exists su name revise session be series def
  su name user ob text of task be text ya
  su name assistant ob text of sketch out be text ya
  su name user ob text of review out be text ya
  prah
  su name better out ob text "Revise the prior answer based on the review." for name author accordingto name revise session to name text better out by num 0 be write do
  exists su name decision out ob text "" be text ya
  ob name better out to name decision out be plus do
prah

ob name review out from text "PASS" be equally then
to name text decision out be accept draft do

ob name review out from text "FAIL" be equally then
to name text decision out be revise draft do

su name decision out ret
prah

ob name text task to name text output be reviewer try do
ob name output be write do
